# AgriFlow Project Structure

This project is a frontend application using Astro and Svelte, built with TypeScript and TailwindCSS.

## Main Architecture

- [src/](mdc:src) - Contains all source code
  - [src/components/](mdc:src/components) - Reusable components
  - [src/layouts/](mdc:src/layouts) - Astro layouts for pages
  - [src/pages/](mdc:src/pages) - Astro pages and API endpoints
  - [src/lib/](mdc:src/lib) - Libraries and utilities
  - [src/types/](mdc:src/types) - TypeScript type definitions
  - [src/styles/](mdc:src/styles) - Global styles
  - [src/assets/](mdc:src/assets) - Static assets
  - [src/i18n/](mdc:src/i18n) - Internationalization

## Configuration

- [astro.config.mjs](mdc:astro.config.mjs) - Astro configuration
- [tsconfig.json](mdc:tsconfig.json) - TypeScript configuration
- [tailwind.config.js](mdc:tailwind.config.js) - TailwindCSS configuration
- [svelte.config.js](mdc:svelte.config.js) - Svelte configuration

